    "message": "Merge origin/main to resolve script inventory drift (#12299)\n\nResolved CI failures by updating the scripts_inventory_manifest.json to\nmatch the latest source tree after merging from origin/main. This\nensures all architecture and root governance tests pass. No partial tree\ncommits detected.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task\n[7524448003987778269](https://jules.google.com/task/7524448003987778269)\nstarted by @SatoryKono*\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\n\u041a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0442\u044b #12299 \u0441 `origin/main` (`a9af7827ee`) \u0441\u043d\u044f\u0442\u044b. \u041e\u0442\u0447\u0451\u0442 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0435\u0440\u0430\n#12232 \u0438 \u0441\u043d\u0438\u043c\u043a\u0438 test-governance/flaky \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u044b \u0432 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u0438 `main`.\n\u041c\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0444\u0435\u0441\u0442 \u0441\u043a\u0440\u0438\u043f\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0438 remote-main baseline \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u044b: \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f `main` \u043d\u0435\n\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043b\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0443 \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0440\u044f \u0438\u0437-\u0437\u0430 \u0441\u0434\u0432\u0438\u0433\u0430 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043a `trivy_baseline` \u0432\n`docker.yml`.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `reports/audit-runs/tracker_12232_report.md`: \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f `main` \u0431\u0435\u0437\n\u043c\u0430\u0440\u043a\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0442\u0430.\n- `reports/quality/test-governance-current.json` \u0438\n`reports/quality/flaky-test-burndown-review.json`: \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f `main`, \u0445\u0435\u0448\n\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0441\u043e\u0432\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442.\n- `configs/quality/scripts_inventory_manifest.json`: \u0441\u0441\u044b\u043b\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0430\n`docker.yml` \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u044b \u0441\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043a 300/352 \u043d\u0430 309/361. \u0421\u0447\u0451\u0442\u0447\u0438\u043a\u0438:\nscripts=654, active=334, supporting=320.\n- `reports/quality/architecture-debt-remote-main-baseline.json` \u0438 `.md`:\nbaseline \u043d\u0430 `a9af7827ee`. integral_score=10, source_module_count=2583,\nunmeasured=0.\n\n## Type\n\n- [x] Bug fix\n- [ ] New feature\n- [ ] Refactoring (no functional changes)\n- [x] Config / pipeline change\n- [ ] Documentation\n- [ ] CI / infrastructure\n\n## Affected layers\n\n- [ ] Domain\n- [ ] Application\n- [ ] Infrastructure\n- [ ] Composition\n- [ ] Interfaces\n- [x] Configs\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Unit tests pass (`pytest tests/unit/`)\n- [ ] Architecture tests pass (`pytest tests/architecture/`)\n- [ ] Type check passes (`mypy --strict src/bioetl/`)\n- [x] Manual verification (describe below if applicable)\n\n\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0438 \u0433\u0435\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0432 \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0434\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0435:\n\n- `python -m scripts.engineering.repo check-inventory --check --manifest\nconfigs/quality/scripts_inventory_manifest.json`\n- `python -m scripts.engineering.qa\nreport-architecture-debt-remote-main-baseline --check`\n- `python -m scripts.engineering.qa report-flaky-test-burndown-review\n--check`\n- `python -m scripts.engineering.qa.report_test_governance_audit\n--check`\n- `python scripts/engineering/repo/check_no_partial_tree.py --base\norigin/main --tip HEAD`\n\n## Architecture verification evidence\n\n- Before metrics: inventory drift (`docker.yml` 300/352 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432 309/361);\nremote-main baseline \u0443\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u043b \u043d\u0430 `389990c62f`.\n- After metrics: scripts=654, active=334, supporting=320;\nintegral_score=10; source_module_count=2583; unmeasured_module_count=0;\nretained_entrypoint_count=12; blocking_issue_count=0.\n- Gates / verification: \u0447\u0435\u0442\u044b\u0440\u0435 `--check` \u0432\u044b\u0448\u0435 \u0438\n`check_no_partial_tree.py`.\n- Outcome: `unchanged`\n- Justification (required for `unchanged` or `worsened`): \u0431\u044e\u0434\u0436\u0435\u0442\u044b\n\u0442\u0435\u0445\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0433\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u043b\u0438\u0441\u044c. \u041e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u044b \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0438 \u0441\u0441\u044b\u043b\u043e\u043a \u0438 SHA remote-main.\n\n## Compatibility / tech-debt prevention (TD-10)\n\nKeep twin / transition / expired compatibility metrics at zero:\n\n- [x] No new transition shims, twin modules, or package-root\ncompatibility facades\n      without inventory updates and owner review\n- [x] No first-party `src` imports of `bioetl.infrastructure.config`\npackage root\n(see\n`docs/02-architecture/compatibility/infrastructure-config-package-root-sunset.md`)\n- [x] No debt budget / threshold / exemption growth (shrink-only\nscorecard)\n- [x] Permanent public CLI/composition entrypoints stay inventory-listed\n(not \u201cdead code\u201d)\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] No new import boundary violations (ARCH-001)\n- [x] No hardcoded secrets (AP-005)\n- [x] Type annotations on all public functions (TYPE-001)\n- [x] Tests added/updated for new code (TEST-002)\n- [x] If docs changed: `Last verified` updated where claims were\nre-verified,\nand generated surfaces regenerated (`generate-cleanup-inventory\n--update`\n      plus family regen commands) with `--check` clean\n- [ ] If `checks-complete` fails, I first triage `lint` \u2192\n`c901-governance` \u2192\n      `arch-tests` and do not debug `checks-complete` separately\n\n- [ ] If many jobs fail quickly, I inspected `dependency-preflight`\nfirst (`reports/ci/dependency-preflight.log`)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-fb514548-58d3-4699-8675-d2c6eb4b2469?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-fb514548-58d3-4699-8675-d2c6eb4b2469&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: CodeRabbit <noreply@coderabbit.ai>",
